      <li><strong>Consume every day you can.</strong><span>Waiting to build a bigger chain cost Rainbows: <span data-g="wait2"></span> per run with a small threshold and <span data-g="wait5"></span> with a large one, against <span data-g="full"></span> when you always consume (no tools).<span class="rule-note"><b>The one exception: don't break a prey mark.</b> When a Lion marks a prey of its own rarity, both rise a tier every morning for free until the mark runs out. Eating the marked prey ends the mark, and so does letting the marked Lion consume, since it usually turns into another beast. Either way you trade several free tiers for one. A consume almost never loses value otherwise: two inmates of one rarity become one a tier higher, which is worth more than the pair.</span></span></li>
====
      <li><strong>能吞噬的日子就吞噬。</strong><span>為了湊出更長的連鎖而等待，反而會少拿綺彩：門檻低時每局 <span data-g="wait2"></span>、門檻高時 <span data-g="wait5"></span>，一律吞噬則是 <span data-g="full"></span>（無刑具）。<span class="rule-note"><b>唯一的例外：別破壞獵物標記。</b>狂獅對同稀有度的獵物打上標記後，兩者每天早上都會免費升一階，直到標記用完。吃掉被標記的獵物會結束標記，讓被標記的狂獅去吞噬也一樣，因為牠通常會變成別種野獸。不管哪種，都是拿好幾階的免費升級去換一階。除此之外，吞噬幾乎不會虧：兩隻同稀有度的囚犯變成一隻高一階的，價值比兩隻加起來還高。</span></span></li>
