==== 監區的一天 ====

<<<< once
    <h2>A day on the block</h2>
    <p>Every day runs in the same order. Here is what the strategy does at each step.</p>
====
    <h2>監區的一天</h2>
    <p>每天都照同樣的順序進行。以下是這套策略在每個步驟的做法。</p>
>>>>
<<<< once
      <li><b>Patrol</b><div><p>Pick one of the three destinations. A locked door usually wins: it adds a new inmate, who may consume today from the warden's cell. Go to a known inmate instead when it has a strong consume waiting. A door with an event badge is a bonus. Prefer the farther destination when they're close: it counts toward Prison Walk, and with the Long-Chained Shackles a walk of 4 or more cells can raise an inmate a tier. Don't open a rat nest before it hatches.</p></div></li>
      <li><b>Event</b><div><p>Accept Ravenous Appetite, High-Risk Convict, Crow Whispers, Taste of Freedom, Extra Portion and the Usurpations, and Behind Closed Doors unless its inmate is already a Supreme. The "Treasure" Hunt has only Confirm: afterwards, the locked doors it leaves dark hold Rare or better. Chain reactions are the close call above. For an Execution, count the inmates it would remove against the tiers the executioner gains, and accept only if you come out ahead.</p></div></li>
      <li><b>Consume</b><div><p>If the warden's inmate has a target, consume. Pick the first meal whose chain is worth the most: the Trainer shows each option's chain odds. After that bite, your game asks for each next meal, and its Cancel stops the chain. Going on is almost always right, so stop only when the Trainer says so. When the eater has more than one meal, pick the one whose next tier still has food for the beast it may re-roll into.</p></div></li>
      <li><b>Replace</b><div><p>If the warden's inmate is low-tier and has nothing worth eating, replace it. A day has a Replace or a consume, not both, so a good consume comes first.</p></div></li>
      <li><b>End the day</b><div><p>Once nothing in the warden's cell can gain, end the day. The next morning, prey marks grow, nests hatch, and new destinations are drawn.</p></div></li>
====
      <li><b>巡視</b><div><p>從三個目的地中選一個。上鎖的門通常最好：它會帶來一隻新囚犯，而且牠今天就可能從典獄長所在的牢房吞噬。如果某隻已知的囚犯有很好的吞噬在等，就改去牠那裡。有事變標示的門是額外獎勵。目的地差不多時選較遠的：可以累積巡獄之路，而持有長鏈腳鐐時，走 4 間以上的牢房還可能讓一隻囚犯升一階。鼠巢孵化前不要打開。</p></div></li>
      <li><b>事變</b><div><p>飢腸轆轆、高危罪犯、鴉之低語、自由的滋味、有福同享和各階僭越都接受；暗箱操作也接受，除非那隻囚犯已經是至臻。尋「寶」只有確認可按：之後它沒點亮的上鎖牢門，裡面都是稀有以上。連鎖反應就是上面說的兩難抉擇。遇到處刑效率時，比較它會移除的囚犯和行刑者得到的階數，只有划算才接受。</p></div></li>
      <li><b>吞噬</b><div><p>典獄長所在牢房的囚犯有目標就吞噬。選連鎖價值最高的第一口：教練會顯示每個選項的連鎖機率。吃完這一口後，遊戲會逐一詢問下一口要吃誰，按取消就會停止連鎖。繼續吃幾乎都是對的，所以只有教練說停時才停。吞噬者有不只一個獵物可選時，選下一階還有食物能餵牠可能重抽成的野獸的那個。</p></div></li>
      <li><b>替換</b><div><p>典獄長所在牢房的囚犯階級低、又沒有值得吃的東西時，就替換牠。一天只能替換或吞噬其中一個，不能兩者都做，所以好的吞噬優先。</p></div></li>
      <li><b>結束這一天</b><div><p>典獄長所在牢房已經沒有任何可以獲益的動作時，就結束這一天。隔天早上，獵物標記成長、鼠巢孵化，並抽出新的目的地。</p></div></li>
>>>>

==== 連鎖 ====

<<<< once
    <h2>Chains: how many beasts you need</h2>
    <p>After every bite the eater rises a tier and re-rolls into a random beast. The chain continues if that new beast has something to eat at its new tier. A Mammoth eats Lions and Wolves, a Lion Wolves and Rats, a Wolf Rats, and a Rat Mammoths. So a Wolf or a Rat waiting at a tier feeds two of the four possible re-rolls, a Lion or a Mammoth one, and a Mammoth, a Rat and a Lion or a Wolf together feed all four.</p>
    <h3>Chance the chain finds its next meal at a tier</h3>
====
    <h2>連鎖：需要幾種野獸</h2>
    <p>每吃一口，吞噬者就升一階並重抽成隨機一種野獸。如果新的野獸在新的階級有東西可吃，連鎖就會繼續。巨象吃狂獅和頭狼，狂獅吃頭狼和碩鼠，頭狼吃碩鼠，碩鼠吃巨象。所以某一階有頭狼或碩鼠在等，可以餵飽四種重抽結果中的兩種；狂獅或巨象只能餵一種；巨象、碩鼠再加上狂獅或頭狼，就能四種全包。</p>
    <h3>連鎖在某一階找到下一口的機率</h3>
