    <p>Most Rainbows come from high eaters chaining up a well-stocked staircase, and chains from the bottom rarely make it in one go. Extra copies of a beast don't help a single chain, since each chain eats one inmate per tier, but they keep the staircase ready for the next one.</p>
    <h3>How long chains run</h3>
====
    <p>大部分的綺彩，來自高階吞噬者沿著貨源充足的「階梯」一路吃上去；從底層起步的連鎖很少能一口氣到頂。同一種野獸多幾隻對單條連鎖沒幫助，因為每條連鎖每一階只吃一隻，但能讓階梯為下一條連鎖做好準備。</p>
